<title>USA: Paging Network, Motorola expand agreement.</title>
<headline>Paging Network, Motorola expand agreement.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paging Network Inc said Thursday it agreed to expand its commitment with Motorola Inc, placing $170 million of purchase orders to manufacture one-way, two-way and voice paging infrastructure through 1999.</p>
<p>The pact is a continuation of PageNet's existing commitment to buy Motorola equipment, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The companies provided no further details.</p>
</text>
